  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MRV tools for forests, land use and agriculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to help accelerate credible GHG emissions reductions in Bolivia and Ecuador by providing key stakeholders from the public, private and financial sectors with enhanced skills and policy recommendations to deploy and improve MRV systems to set and track progress against NDC and sustainability targets in the AFOLU sector, unlocking climate finance and ultimately providing certainty, strengthening environmental integrity and embedding GESI and safeguards in climate action.</narrative>
  </description>
